# Monorepo Workspace Standards

- **Boundary Discipline**: Apps (`apps/*`) must consume shared logic via packages (`@repo/ui`, `@repo/shared-types`). Sibling apps must NEVER cross-import each other's code.
- **Contract First**: When updating API contracts in `packages/shared-types`, update both producer and consumer.
- **Commands**: Execute workspace commands using `pnpm --filter <app-name> <command>` or root `pnpm turbo <command>`.
- **Turborepo Outputs**: Never write untracked build artifacts outside configured `turbo.json` outputs.

